an></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,d,\\tau\\in V\">\\(X,d,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricSpace}_S(X,d)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\)</span> (metric-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ce876585d129ce97\" href=\"?note=ce876585d129ce97\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md\">../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_d(x,r)\">\\(B_d(x,r)\\)</span> (open metric ball, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c0dd9ffea872a14a\" href=\"?note=c0dd9ffea872a14a\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-ball.md\">../batch03/58-df-ball.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMetricConnectedSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMetricConnectedSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}connected\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricConnectedSpace}_S(X,d,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(B_d(x,r)\\subseteq U)\\}\\land \\neg\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(U\\neq\\varnothing\\land V\\neq\\varnothing\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing\\land X=U\\cup V)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}metric\\text{-}connected\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMetricConnectedSpace}_S(X,d,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcMetricSpace}_S(X,d)\\land \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land \\tau=\\{U\\subseteq X:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;(B_d(x,r)\\subseteq U)\\}\\land \\neg\\exists U,V\\in\\tau\\;(U\\neq\\varnothing\\land V\\neq\\varnothing\\land U\\cap V=\\varnothing\\land X=U\\cup V)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-connected.md","status":"resolved","id":"71801f5b9407391a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-connected.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-ball.md","status":"resolved","id":"c0dd9ffea872a14a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-ball.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-metric-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ce876585d129ce97","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","head